# Perigee Beckoner's warp {1}{B} (CR 702.185a): with only the white and green of Mox Pearl and Mox Emerald in the pool the warp cast
# is refused (no black), and once Mox Jet is cast and tapped it is paid exactly - the pool keeps only the Emerald's {G} - and
# the enters trigger pumps the Memnite; the Beckoner is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Memnite
Perigee Beckoner
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Perigee Beckoner.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Perigee Beckoner.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 3
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Exile = Perigee Beckoner
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 3
